OL,3,AFive shot in Washington DC, police say,
OL,4,Awith suspect barricaded in building
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least five people have been shot in
OL,7,Fcentral Washington DC, in what police
OL,8,Fcall an "active shooting" - the suspect
OL,9,Fhas barricaded themselves in a building
OL,11,FAt the moment, officers "don't know the
OL,12,Fstatus" of the victims - here's the
OL,13,Flatest recap
OL,15,FThe shooting happened inside and near a
OL,16,Fgym in Logan Circle - one witness
OL,17,Fthought an exercise ball had popped,
OL,18,Fwhen in fact someone had been shot
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
