OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC producer Jonathan Csapo lives in
OL,7,Fthe building: Gunshots went off very,
OL,8,Fvery close to where I was, he says. I
OL,9,Fcould see the smoke, I could see the
OL,10,Fflash. We just all started running
